"This configures how much Krita likes to swap. Move the slider to the left, "
"and there is no swapping at all. Move it to the right there is a lot of "
"swapping going on."
msgstr ""
"Isto configura canto ha usar Krita a memoria virtual. Mova a barra para a "
"esquerda para non usala. Movéndoa para a dereita usase bastante paxinación "
"na memoria virtual."

