#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:180
msgid ""
"Paint with the smudge color instead of the brush color. The smudge color is "
"slowly changed to the color you are painting on.\n"
" 0.0 do not use the smudge color\n"
" 0.5 mix the smudge color with the brush color\n"
" 1.0 use only the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Pintar coración  viscosa no canto da coración de pincel. A coración viscosa "
"refírese a que a cor cámbiase a poucos á cor sobre da que esta a pintar.\n"
"0.0 non empregar cores viscosas\n"
"0.5 mestura a coración viscosa coa coración de pincel\n"
"1.0 empregar só a coración viscosa"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:181
msgid "smudge length"
msgstr "desprazamento da viscosidade"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:181
msgid ""
"This controls how fast the smudge color becomes the color you are painting "
"on.\n"
"0.0 immediately change the smudge color\n"
"1.0 never change the smudge color"
msgstr ""
"Isto controla como de rápido se fai a transición na coración viscosa cara a "
"cor sobre da que se pinta.\n"
"0.0 cambia a coración inmediatamente\n"
"1.0 non se cambia a coración"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:182
msgid "eraser"
msgstr "borrador"

#: plugins/paintops/mypaint/mypaint_brush_resource.cpp:182
msgid ""
